{"id": "prob-038", "source": {"group": "train", "id": "prob-038", "identity_verified": true, "input_binding": "active-497-row-bindings.jsonl", "input_binding_line": 41, "record_version_sha256": "9ea4a3ee9181d11913920e97c621e75a4b5bf7a7ed6c7228b36fbf461e0113d6", "source_line": 1, "source_path": "data/v2/train/leakage-isolated-v3-2026-10-05/dataset_prob.jsonl", "source_raw_sha256": "8c91bd17227db6f25018939d4a995cd056a5123fb2eee2754681b9a41b363fd0", "task_sha256": "3f126e0160543d387c893e427a38fed2db91c7f5f3cd5bf1bf804c581350d08d"}, "base_math_record_dense_sha256": "dbf8ce52a3e6695caee595c74927a82c3242658e76c8543811c6d921742833e2", "math_fields_dense_sha256": "73d511336c89c5b355190e114140ad4127f555c45b511a71528208b59ea05bae", "final_record_dense_sha256": "e066b66c10c31e1696fe12f76beca667ed27d960f0ad07b87bdf6033de1591c5", "scene_updated": true, "scene_spec": {"objects": ["单位面积矩形的四个精确分区", "两个条件样本空间的归一化"], "steps": ["把 $[0,1)^2$ 沿横轴分成宽为 $2/5,1/5,1/5,1/5$ 的四条带，依次代表 $A\\setminus B,A\\cap B,B\\setminus A,(A\\cup B)^c$。", "四区面积和为 $1$，显示 $P(A)=3/5$、$P(B)=2/5$、$P(A\\cap B)=1/5$。", "按 $B$ 归一化得到 $P(A\\mid B)=(1/5)/(2/5)=1/2$；按 $A$ 归一化得到 $P(B\\mid A)=(1/5)/(3/5)=1/3$。"]}, "visual_style": "集合运算与面积动态切割", "old_scene_spec_sha256": "7792b6ea171724cce2042192cba47f446036584e0a6a964555ac086fe61c6ad4", "new_scene_spec_sha256": "5190cfc51de43890903ea0f9f0b1641dbf2e3e9358deb2248541a5163bd05ba5", "scene_sha_encoding": "json-sortkeys-compact-utf8", "rationale": "用可精确构造的分区代替未给出精确面积构造的重叠圆，改为原生字典。"}
{"id": "prob-039", "source": {"group": "train", "id": "prob-039", "identity_verified": true, "input_binding": "active-497-row-bindings.jsonl", "input_binding_line": 42, "record_version_sha256": "916010ea92d0857c6d2e1742f923cdf7af4116c2b815fac353b326ad8c293361", "source_line": 2, "source_path": "data/v2/train/leakage-isolated-v3-2026-10-05/dataset_prob.jsonl", "source_raw_sha256": "8c91bd17227db6f25018939d4a995cd056a5123fb2eee2754681b9a41b363fd0", "task_sha256": "88f4fbf0c8b55dd3a18a98303f69908cbb6b12b2572c44dd91aca4035134a1f9"}, "base_math_record_dense_sha256": "9dbe554538d3b9338f7feb7e2e64e3bd07b80682711ff9219f8ae1c1b616bf04", "math_fields_dense_sha256": "fc8be8eec7c72dbc1df655bbd7c17d18039c6046cc972571ff40e52459f31cdd", "final_record_dense_sha256": "8c94536343eea68551afbd11b64cfa1961a76444c899a8c3acbc00e8840f07f7", "scene_updated": true, "scene_spec": {"objects": ["边长为二的正方形和单位圆", "有限样本的精确计数比", "期望方差与切比雪夫界"], "steps": ["均匀独立取点于 $[-1,1]^2$，标注单点入圆概率 $p=\\pi/4$。", "显示给定样本的精确有理数 $\\widehat\\pi_n=4m_n/n$，不将它写成与 $\\pi$ 的有限样本恒等式。", "显示 $E(\\widehat\\pi_n)=\\pi$，$\\operatorname{Var}(\\widehat\\pi_n)=\\pi(4-\\pi)/n$。", "对 $\\varepsilon>0$ 显示 $P(|\\widehat\\pi_n-\\pi|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\le\\pi(4-\\pi)/(n\\varepsilon^2)\\to0$。", "结论为 $\\widehat\\pi_n\\xrightarrow{P}\\pi$；圆周率保持符号 $\\pi$，不使用小数逼近。"]}, "visual_style": "空间撒点与频率逼近", "old_scene_spec_sha256": "e483ec7b0433f731dddcc8a94851f408d9175a59ded51c758936569c5bad9756", "new_scene_spec_sha256": "d7d3375d93233e7d504982e0e49c27e9a0270611277414ee05c41e546be979cf", "scene_sha_encoding": "json-sortkeys-compact-utf8", "rationale": "删除圆周率小数和近似恒等式，与新题的精确统计目标对齐。"}
{"id": "prob-042", "source": {"group": "train", "id": "prob-042", "identity_verified": true, "input_binding": "active-497-row-bindings.jsonl", "input_binding_line": 45, "record_version_sha256": "3f70da56d2084427141488add9d6b5e007cdf8124c9c4ced27c2fd4dce3766c9", "source_line": 5, "source_path": "data/v2/train/leakage-isolated-v3-2026-10-05/dataset_prob.jsonl", "source_raw_sha256": "8c91bd17227db6f25018939d4a995cd056a5123fb2eee2754681b9a41b363fd0", "task_sha256": "eb53315d0b7b792d07aa88cdff4b8994a326989c15b923315731f2b0edbf764b"}, "base_math_record_dense_sha256": "231cc57b8a66ce2334abcd184d2768898652a6ba5301d52f42e9b5455781904e", "math_fields_dense_sha256": "eec36cc3e0a330413935ae340a7b51aafbec86398b02df46cc4e8801ac30b535", "final_record_dense_sha256": "b0ee9a9e5a5e03559b564cf4fee3d4545f9fc58ec8e767975686788543a06a67", "scene_updated": true, "scene_spec": {"objects": ["一般参数的频率图", "期望方差标签", "概率上界"], "steps": ["标明各次为独立同分布 Bernoulli$(p)$，其中 $0\\le p\\le1$；水平参考线为 $y=p$。", "显示 $F_n=n^{-1}\\sum_{i=1}^nX_i$、$E(F_n)=p$、$\\operatorname{Var}(F_n)=p(1-p)/n$。", "显示 $P(|F_n-p|\\ge\\varepsilon)\\le\\min\\{1,p(1-p)/(n\\varepsilon^2)\\}\\to0$。", "只在附加公平条件时取 $p=1/2$；频率图为示意，结论由上述不等式给出。"]}, "visual_style": "动态折线与频率收敛", "old_scene_spec_sha256": "c362b1a3546be1a2711a22e40f302675be5b60eadf77436830cb22fa1b2466de", "new_scene_spec_sha256": "691ecf261d1a4ca6135403cd813f051f1f7e7c477f4e7e92fd035e84ed0dc675", "scene_sha_encoding": "json-sortkeys-compact-utf8", "rationale": "一般参数与公平附加条件分开，保留精确界及原生字典。"}
